===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|nl|dum|jacht}}, {{m|dum|jaecht}}, {{m|dum|jaget}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|*jagot}}, from {{inh|nl|gmw-pro|*jagōþu||hunt, hunting}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|nl|jagen|t1=to hunt|-t|t2=verbal noun|id2=verbal noun}}. Cognate with {{cog|de|Jagd}}. The form {{m|dum||jaecht}} is due to contraction and {{m|dum||jacht}} to subsequent pre-cluster shortening. (Compare {{m|nl|maagd}}, in which an analogous development was probably hindered by the potential homophone {{m|nl|macht}}.)

====Noun====
{{nl-noun|f|-|-}}

# [[hunt]], [[hunting]]
# [[chase]], [[pursuit]]

